WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:08.731
This tutorial shows how to create a shift and offer it to staff in one step, using

2
00:00:08.731 --> 00:00:10.841
fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:11.301 --> 00:00:14.760
On Shifts, select New shift.

4
00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:20.502
Choose the venue and the role. The address fills in from the venue.

5
00:00:20.964 --> 00:00:25.588
Set the date, the start and end times, and the break.

6
00:00:26.739 --> 00:00:33.502
Select staff to open the Select Staff page. Tick the people to offer the shift to,

7
00:00:33.502 --> 00:00:35.152
then select Confirm.

8
00:00:35.615 --> 00:00:42.384
Select Send Offer. Crewflow creates the shift and sends an offer to each person.

9
00:00:42.844 --> 00:00:48.549
The result lists every offer that was sent, and explains any person who could not be

10
00:00:48.549 --> 00:00:49.772
offered the shift.
